g=\"1008\"></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div data-status=\"Unavailable\" data-slug=\"1007\"></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div data-status=\"Unavailable\" data-slug=\"1006\"></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div data-status=\"Unavailable\" data-slug=\"1005\"></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div data-status=\"Unavailable\" data-slug=\"1004\"></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div data-status=\"Unavailable\" data-slug=\"1003\"></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div data-status=\"Unavailable\" data-slug=\"1002\"></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><div data-status=\"Unavailable\" data-slug=\"1001\"></div></div></div></div></div>"},"/apartments/2001":{"title":"Unit 2001 on floor Penthouseth | Journalist House Tel Aviv","bodyClass":"","embeds":[{"c":"global-css w-embed","h":"<style>\n  :root {\n    --font-from: 10;\n    --font-to: 10;\n    --vw-from: calc(1920 / 100);\n    --vw-to: calc(2849 / 100);\n    --coefficient: calc((var(--font-to) - var(--font-from)) / (var(--vw-to) - var(--vw-from)));\n    --base: calc((var(--font-from) - var(--vw-from) * var(--coefficient)) / 16);\n  }\n\n  html {\n    font-size: calc(var(--base) * 1rem + var(--coefficient) * 1vw);\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 1920px) {\n    :root {\n      --font-from: 6;\n      --font-to: 10;\n      --vw-from: calc(991 / 100);\n      --vw-to: calc(1920 / 100);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n    :root {\n      --font-from: 10;\n      --font-to: 10;\n      --vw-from: calc(1 / 100);\n      --vw-to: calc(991 / 100);\n    }\n  }\n  @media screen and (min-width: 992px) {\n    .chapter-tile:hover .chapter-link-arrow {\n      transform: translate(0rem, 0px);\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<style>\n  /* Remove gray tap highlight on iOS */\n  a,\n  button,\n  input,\n  textarea,\n  .contact-us_x-wrapper {\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n  }\n\n  a,\n  button {\n    outline: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Make text look crisper and more legible in all browsers */\n  body {\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n    font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  html.lenis,\n  html.lenis body {\n    height: auto;\n  }\n  .lenis.lenis-smooth {\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n  }\n  .lenis.lenis-smooth [data-lenis-prevent] {\n    overscroll-behavior: contain;\n  }\n  .lenis.lenis-stopped {\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .lenis.lenis-smooth iframe {\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  html.is-preloading {\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n</style>\n<style>\n  .wf-design-mode .loader {\n    display: none;\n  }\n  /* Add auto overflow in webflow to make editing easier */\n  .wf-design-mode [data-horizontal-scroll-wrap] {\n    overflow: auto;\n  }\n  [data-load-reset] {\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n\n  .chapter-tile__thumb-wrapper:hover .chapter-tile__thumb {\n    transform: scale(1.05);\n  }\n\n  /* .chapter-tile:hover .chapter-link-arrow {\n    transform: translate(0rem, 0px);\n  } */\n  .chapter-tile:hover .chapter-link-hovered {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<style>\n  /* Chapter menu — always legible on any background.\n   White ink + difference blend = the menu paints as the inverse of whatever is\n   behind it, so it stays visible over any colour or full-bleed image. */\n  .chapter-menu-c {\n    mix-blend-mode: difference;\n    background-color: transparent; /* any solid bg here would blend and kill the effect */\n  }\n  /* Ink must be white so 'difference' inverts the backdrop into a contrasting colour. */\n  .chapter-menu-c {\n    color: #fff;\n  } /* label text */\n  .chapter-menu-c .chapter-track {\n    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n  } /* faint line */\n  .chapter-menu-c .chapter-track-fake {\n    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n  } /* faint line */\n\n  .chapter-menu-c .chapter-track-fake.is--journy-2 {\n    background-color: #fff;\n  } /* faint line */\n  .chapter-menu-c .chapter-fill {\n    background-color: #fff;\n  } /* progress fill */\n\n  /* Scroll-lock while the Inquire modal is open (Lenis is stopped; this kills native fallback scroll) */\n  html.is-inquire-open {\n    overflow: hidden;\n    scrollbar-gutter: stable;\n  }\n  /* Modal hidden until JS takes over */\n  [mt-el='inquire-modal'] {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  #language-bar,\n  .enable-bottomlinks-feedback,\n  .enable-toolbar-links-section.enable-toolbar-link-powered-by,\n  .keyboard-shorcut {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<!-- Mobile Sliders thumbs and scrollbars -->\n<style>\n  @media (max-width: 991px) {\n    [data-scrollbar] {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      overflow-y: hidden;\n      scrollbar-width: none;\n    }\n    [data-scrollbar]::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      display: none;\n    }\n    [data-scrollbar] > * {\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* Override per slider by setting these variables on the slider's parent */\n  [data-scrollbar-track] {\n    position: relative;\n    width: var(--scrollbar-track-width, calc(100% - 4rem));\n    height: 3px;\n    margin: var(--scrollbar-gap, 24px) auto 0;\n  }\n  [data-scrollbar-track]::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 1px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: #ddd8d7;\n  }\n  [data-scrollbar-thumb] {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: #000;\n    touch-action: none;\n  }\n\n  @media (min-width: 992px) {\n    [data-scrollbar-track] {\n      display: none;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"},{"c":"page-styles w-embed","h":"<style>\n  [mt-unit-floor='The Penthouse'].units-nav_building-link {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n\n  [href='/apartments/2001'] {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n  .is--unavailable path {\n    fill: black;\n    opacity: 0.4 !important;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 379px) {\n    .units_left-inner {\n      display: flex;\n      grid-auto-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n\n  /* Mobile/touch: iOS treats the first tap as :hover, and the units-nav hotspots\n   fade 0 -> ~0.5 on hover, so the first tap is eaten and only the second navigates.\n   Pin :hover = resting opacity on touch so a single tap fires the link immediately.\n   Desktop hover (hover:hover) is untouched. */\n  @media (hover: none) {\n    .units-nav_building-link:hover,\n    .units-nav__top-view-link:hover {\n      opacity: 0;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"},{"c":"navbar-size-shrink-code w-embed","h":"<style>\n  @media (min-width: 992px) {\n    .chapter-tile__thumb-wrapper {\n      aspect-ratio: 277 / 291;\n      min-height: 0;\n      max-height: 100%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .chapter-tile__thumb {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .chapter-tile {\n      min-height: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    .chapter-bottom_wrap {\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .chapter-menu__grid {\n      flex: 0 1 auto;\n      min-height: 0;\n      align-content: center;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"},{"c":"hamburger_embed w-embed","h":"<style>\n  @media (min-width: 992px) {\n    .hamburger_5_wrap {\n      --thickness: 0.2rem;\n      --gap: 1rem;\n      --rotate: 35;\n      --width: 100%;\n    }\n    .w--open .hamburger_5_line {\n      transform: scaleX(0);\n    }\n    .w--open .hamburger_5_line:first-child {\n      transform: translateY(calc(var(--thickness) + var(--gap))) rotate(calc(var(--rotate) * -1deg));\n    }\n    .w--open .hamburger_5_line:last-child {\n      transform: translateY(calc(var(--thickness) * -1 + var(--gap) * -1)) rotate(calc(var(--rotate) * 1deg));\n    }\n  }\n\n    @media (max-width: 991px) {\n    .hamburger_5_wrap {\n      --thickness: 0.1rem;\n      --gap: 0.5rem;\n      --rotate: 45;\n      --width: 100%;\n    }\n    .w--open .hamburger_5_line {\n      transform: scaleX(0);\n    }\n    .w--open .hamburger_5_line:first-child {\n      transform: translateY(calc(var(--thickness) + var(--gap))) rotate(calc(var(--rotate) * -1deg));\n    }\n    .w--open .hamburger_5_line:last-child {\n      transform: translateY(calc(var(--thickness) * -1 + var(--gap) * -1)) rotate(calc(var(--rotate) * 1deg));\n    }\n  }\n</style>"}],"scripts":["https://jurnalist-house-2026.vercel.app/pages/apartments.js"],"inline":["\n  // Hebrew locale (/he, dir=\"rtl\") loads the Hebrew build; every other page loads English.\n  document.write('<script defer src=\"https://jurnalist-house-2026.vercel.app/' + (document.documentElement.dir === \"rtl\" ? \"he/\" : \"\") + 'global.js\"><\\/script>');\n"],"main":"<section class=\"section_units\"><div id=\"w-node-_48679802-911f-e509-7eb9-f0925ce621d6-dbaffbb9\" class=\"units_left\"><div data-lenis-prevent=\"\" class=\"units_left-inner\"><div id=\"w-node-_8cb117e3-ffba-82cb-c8b7-2aace7c713c4-dbaffbb9\" class=\"units_left-top\"><div class=\"units_text-wrapper\"><div class=\"units_medium-text is--10px-mobile\">RESIDeNCE</div><div mt-el=\"ctx-unit\" class=\"units_big-text is--10px-mobile\">2001</div></div><div class=\"units_text-wrapper\"><div class=\"units_medium-text is--10px-mobile\">section</div><div mt-el=\"ctx-type\" class=\"units_big-text is--10px-mobile\">The Penthouse</div></div><div class=\"out-space-grid\"><div class=\"units_text-wrapper\"><div class=\"units_medium-text is--10px-mobile\">floor</div><div mt-el=\"ctx-floor\" class=\"units_big-text is--10px-mobile\">20</div></div></div><div class=\"out-space-grid\"><div class=\"units_text-wrapper\"><div class=\"units_medium-text is--10px-mobile\">Apartment Area</div><div mt-el=\"ctx-area\" class=\"units_texts-inner\"><div class=\"units_big-text is--10px-mobile\">370</div><div class=\"units_small-text is--10px-mobile\">sqm</div></div></div><div class=\"units_text-wrapper\"><div mt-el=\"ctx-outdoor-label\" class=\"units_medium-text is--10px-mobile\">Terrace Area</div><div mt-el=\"ctx-outdoor\" class=\"units_texts-inner\"><div class=\"